Package: qishi-note-vault
Version: 1.0.001
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: qishiyi <qishiyi77@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Description: Private Markdown knowledge base for TOS
 Local Markdown notes with tags, search, pin, archive,
 trash, import/export, and backup support. The WebUI
 communicates with a local Python service over the
 TOS Unix socket proxy.
